    <h3>Definition 2.2.</h3>
    <p>We define a corresponding array <span data-field="f_n_k_array">{{ f_n_k_array }}</span> by setting <span data-field="f_n_k_summation">{{ f_n_k_summation }}</span>. We call this array Borel's triangle. Equivalently,</p>
    <p>
      <span style="display: inline-block; margin-right: 20px;">
        <span style="font-size: 1.2em;">\sum_{k=0}^{n} C_{n,k} (t+1)^k = \sum_{k=0}^{n} f_{n,k} t^k.</span>
      </span>
    </p>
    <p>Rows zero through four of this array are below.</p>
