    <p>If <span data-field="X">{{ X }}</span>, we set <span data-field="a_empty">{{ a_empty }}</span>.</p>
    <p>An alternate recursive definition of <span data-field="φ">{{ φ }}</span> is as follows. Let <span data-field="T_b">{{ T_b }}</span> be a leaf-marked tree, and set <span data-field="φ(r)">{{ φ(r) }}</span>, where <span data-field="r">{{ r }}</span> is the root of <span data-field="T_b">{{ T_b }}</span>. Now let <span data-field="v">{{ v }}</span> be a child of <span data-field="w">{{ w }}</span>:</p>
