  <section>
    <h3>Lemma 3.2.</h3>
    <p>Let <span data-field="T_b">{{ T_b }}</span> be a tree with <span data-field="n_vertices_l32">{{ n_vertices_l32 }}</span> vertices $\to$ {monomials} be the map sending a tree <span data-field="T_b">{{ T_b }}</span> to the first entry of <span data-field="EK_pair">{{ EK_pair }}</span>. Then <span data-field="φ">{{ φ }}</span> is a bijection between trees with vertices and generators of <span data-field="I_n">{{ I_n }}</span>.</p>
