        <p>Example 5.3. Let <span data-field="variable_T">{{ variable_T }}</span> be the tree from Figure <span data-field="variable_5">{{ variable_5 }}</span>. Tracing the bijections, <span data-field="variable_T">{{ variable_T }}</span> corresponds</p>
